# Delete-shaped routes without a .delete key, and .delete keys on routes that are not delete-shaped (tools/checkroutes).
# Each by Appendix A.3: resets to a default, undo routes, the caller's own data, relations and public flows.
# METHOD /api/path | A.3 row and reason
DELETE /api/auth/account | A.3 #4: own account (self)
DELETE /api/auth/account/avatar | A.3 #6: own avatar (self)
DELETE /api/auth/account/table-prefs/:tableKey | A.3 #12: own table settings back to the default (self)
DELETE /api/auth/google/link | A.3 #18: own Google link (self)
DELETE /api/auth/google/pending | A.3 #20: public flow; gives up the browser's own pending link (ticket cookie)
DELETE /api/auth/last-email | A.3 #26: public flow; clears the browser's own cookie
DELETE /api/auth/passkeys/:id | A.3 #30: own passkey (self)
DELETE /api/auth/sessions | A.3 #39: own other sessions (self)
DELETE /api/auth/sessions/:id | A.3 #41: own session (self)
PATCH /api/users/:userID/role | A.3 #690: a role change revokes and grants, all-of access.grants.create and access.grants.delete
DELETE /api/assistant/sessions/:id | A.3 #83: the caller's own brain session (sessions are the caller's own in the brain), cyberbrain.chat.use
DELETE /api/assistant/sessions/:id/attachments/:aid | A.3 #86: an attachment of the caller's own brain session, cyberbrain.chat.use
DELETE /api/exercises/:id/draft | A.3 #456: discards the task draft (undo), the update keys or authorship
POST /api/exercises/elevations/:elevationID/reject | A.3 #509: deciding a request, exercises.elevations.update ("approve or reject them", A.2)
POST /api/exercises/proposals/:proposalID/reject | A.3 #532: deciding a proposal, exercises.publish ("review catalog proposals", A.2; round 3)
